AUDIO: 'We\'ve finally achieved this, and laptops are now powerful enough to completely replace desktop computers. I\'ve been using a laptop as my primary work device for years, connected to four monitors. It\'s faster, quieter, and cheaper than my homemade Windows computer.'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'The problem is that no laptop can connect to all the peripherals on your desk, especially MacBooks, which often only have two or three USB-C ports. You\'ll need to buy a docking station like this one that connects to your MacBook and'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'provides every port imaginable. This particular docking station is the Vankey Fusion Dock Ultra. As far as I know, this is the most expensive and most powerful docking station on the market today. I\'ll quickly explain what makes this dock so'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'special, but more importantly, I\'ll explain why you almost certainly don\'t need it. I\'ll tell you what to consider when buying a docking station and help you save a lot of money. I reviewed the'

