AUDIO: 'speeds of 40 gigabits per second. This is incredibly fast until you start adding the speed of all the devices you want to connect to your computer at the same time. And the most important thing that'

[04:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'no one thinks about is external monitors. If you only have one 4K 60Hz monitor, it will take up 13 gigabits per second. If you have a 4K 120Hz display, this value increases to 26'

